      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen3.5 multi-image recognition\n\n**Model:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen3.5_4b_bf16.safetensors`\nDownload: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_4b_bf16.safetensors\n\n**Use:** drop 2–3 images into Image 1 / 2 / 3, then Queue.\nNeed only 2 images: disconnect Image 3 and wire ImageBatch (id 5) straight into TextGenerate.\nNeed more than 3: add `Load Image (from Folder)` (`LoadImageDataSetFromFolder`), put files in `ComfyUI/input/<folder>/`, connect its `images` output to TextGenerate `image`.\n\nQwen3.5 2B / 9B also work in CLIPLoader if you swap the file.\nNeeds a recent ComfyUI (TextGenerate + Qwen3.5, PR #12771 / #13943)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen3.5 multi-image recognition\n\n**Model:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen3.5_4b_bf16.safetensors`\nDownload: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_4b_bf16.safetensors\n\n**Use:** drop 2–3 images into Image 1 / 2 / 3, then Queue.\nNeed only 2 images: disconnect Image 3 and wire ImageBatch (id 5) straight into TextGenerate.\nNeed more than 3: add `Load Image (from Folder)` (`LoadImageDataSetFromFolder`), put files in `ComfyUI/input/<folder>/`, connect its `images` output to TextGenerate `image`.\n\nQwen3.5 2B / 9B also work in CLIPLoader if you swap the file.\nNeeds a recent ComfyUI (TextGenerate + Qwen3.5, PR #12771 / #13943)."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
